      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "1",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.1",
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.1"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stedfast [is] the word: If any one the oversight doth long for, a right work he desireth;\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.1",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.1"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.1",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.1"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.1"
        },
        {
          "verse": "2",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.2",
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.2"
        },
        {
          "text": "it behoveth, therefore, the overseer to be blameless, of one wife a husband, vigilant, sober, decent, a friend of strangers, apt to teach,\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.2",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.2"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.2",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.2"
        },
        {
          "verse": "3",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.3",
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.3"
        },
        {
          "text": "not given to wine, not a striker, not given to filthy lucre, but gentle, not contentious, not a lover of money,\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.3",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.3"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.3",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.3"
        },
        {
          "verse": "4",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.4",
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.4"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.4"
        },
        {
          "text": "his own house leading well, having children in subjection with all gravity,\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.4",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.4"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.4"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.4",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.4"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.4"
        },
        {
          "verse": "5",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.5",
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.5"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.5"
        },
        {
          "text": "(and if any one his own house [how] to lead hath not known, how an assembly of God shall he take care of?)\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.5",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.5"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.5"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.5",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.5"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.5"
        },
        {
          "verse": "6",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.6",
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.6"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.6"
        },
        {
          "text": "not a new convert, lest having been puffed up he may fall to a judgment of the devil;\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.6",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.6"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.6"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.6",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.6"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.6"
        },
        {
          "verse": "7",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.7",
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.7"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.7"
        },
        {
          "text": "and it behoveth him also to have a good testimony from those without, that he may not fall into reproach and a snare of the devil.\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.7",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.7"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.7"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.7",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.7"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.7"
        },
        {
          "verse": "8",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.8",
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.8"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.8"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ministrants — in like manner grave, not double-tongued, not given to much wine, not given to filthy lucre,\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.8",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.8"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.8"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.8",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.8"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.8"
        },
        {
          "verse": "9",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.9",
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.9"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.9"
        },
        {
          "text": "having the secret of the faith in a pure conscience,\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.9",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.9"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.9"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.9",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.9"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.9"
        },
        {
          "verse": "10",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.10",
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.10"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.10"
        },
        {
          "text": "and let these also first be proved, then let them minister, being unblameable.\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.10",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.10"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.10"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.10",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.10"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.10"
        },
        {
          "verse": "11",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.11",
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.11"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Women — in like manner grave, not false accusers, vigilant, faithful in all things.\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.11",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.11"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.11"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.11",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.11"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.11"
        },
        {
          "verse": "12",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.12",
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.12"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ministrants — let them be of one wife husbands; the children leading well, and their own houses,\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.12",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.12"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.12"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.12",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.12"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.12"
        },
        {
          "verse": "13",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.13",
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.13"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.13"
        },
        {
          "text": "for those who did minister well a good step to themselves do acquire, and much boldness in faith that [is] in Christ Jesus.\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.13",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.13"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.13"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.13",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.13"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.13"
        },
        {
          "verse": "14",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.14",
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.14"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.14"
        },
        {
          "text": "These things I write to thee, hoping to come unto thee soon,\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.14",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.14"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.14"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.14",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.14"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.14"
        },
        {
          "verse": "15",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.15",
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.15"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.15"
        },
        {
          "text": "and if I delay, that thou mayest know how it behoveth [thee] to conduct thyself in the house of God, which is an assembly of the living God — a pillar and foundation of the truth,\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.15",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.15"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.15"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.15",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.15"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.15"
        },
        {
          "verse": "16",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.16",
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.16"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.16"
        },
        {
          "text": "and, confessedly, great is the secret of piety — God was manifested in flesh, declared righteous in spirit, seen by messengers, preached among nations, believed on in the world, taken up in glory!\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.16",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.16"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.16"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1TI.3.16",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1TI.3.16"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1TI.3.16"
        }
      ]
